1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:04,133
一张玻片，一片人肝组织。
One glass slide. One slice of human liver.

2
00:00:05,620 --> 00:00:10,667
宽 4.8 毫米。染色让胶原呈蓝色。
4.8 mm across. The stain turns collagen blue.

3
00:00:10,950 --> 00:00:15,995
这个直径 1 毫米的圆里，蓝色占 13.5%。
In this 1 mm circle, blue covers 13.5%.

4
00:00:16,850 --> 00:00:20,963
相隔 1.4 毫米：32.6%。
1.4 mm away: 32.6%.

5
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:27,152
同一片组织，同一种染色，蓝色是 2.4 倍。
Same slice, same stain: 2.4 times the blue.

6
00:00:29,350 --> 00:00:33,010
一个细胞核，直径 8.5 微米。
One nucleus, 8.5 microns across.

7
00:00:33,050 --> 00:00:36,656
每个数字，都量自这张扫描本身。
Every number here was measured from the scan itself.
